2T19:10:24Z"}],"body":"\r\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at e464d79398edc69ae7eb67dcc78238d33b8a3a1d -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Changes\r\n* Fix direct queries on TOML arrays of tables by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/65\r\n* Fix Terraform object attributes in HCL round trips by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/66\r\n* Fix gron panic, integer precision loss and nondeterministic output by @JFryy in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/72\r\n* Reject malformed env assignments by @bensynapse in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/75\r\n* Stringify non-string YAML mapping keys (fixes #73) by @cristianchiriac in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/74\r\n* Normalize YAML timestamp values for gojq by @jihtsan in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/77\r\n* feat: add flag to preserve map key order across transcoded formats by @edsilegxrepo in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/55\r\n* fix: decouple interactive REPL buffer from target output format by @edsilegxrepo in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/57\r\n### Dependencies\r\n* Bump the go_modules group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/78\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @bensynapse made their first contribution in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/75\r\n* @cristianchiriac made their first contribution in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/74\r\n* @jihtsan made their first contribution in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/77\r\n* @edsilegxrepo made their first contribution in https://github.com/JFryy/qq/pull/55\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/JFryy/qq/compare/v0.4.0...v0.5.0\r\n\r\n","mentions_count":6}
